{"id":"17723ef24b90eee6","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-chen-prime.md","title":"Chen Prime","display":"df-chen-prime — Chen Prime","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-chen-prime","aliases":["58-df-chen-prime"],"display":"df-chen-prime — Chen Prime","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-chen-prime"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-chen-prime</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-chen-prime — Chen Prime"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3322615e4eea05e9\" href=\"?note=3322615e4eea05e9\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-prime.md\">../batch20/58-df-prime.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q_1,q_2\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(p,q_1,q_2\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>（素数谓词，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3322615e4eea05e9\" href=\"?note=3322615e4eea05e9\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-prime.md\">../batch20/58-df-prime.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChenPrime}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ChenPrime}_S\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chen-prime} \\vdash \\mathrm{ChenPrime}_S(p)\\leftrightarrow\\left(p\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\\land\\exists q_1,q_2\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left((q_1=1\\lor\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(q_1))\\land\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(q_2)\\land p+2=q_1q_2\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chen-prime} \\vdash \\mathrm{ChenPrime}_S(p)\\leftrightarrow\\left(p\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\\land\\exists q_1,q_2\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left((q_1=1\\lor\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(q_1))\\land\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(q_2)\\land p+2=q_1q_2\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Chen (1973): every large odd number is sum of prime and almost prime.</li>\n<li>&quot;Almost prime&quot; means product of at most <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> primes.</li>\n<li>Rank of Selberg sieve controls bound <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Chen's theorem: every large even number is sum of prime and product of at most 2 primes.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-prime.md","status":"resolved","id":"3322615e4eea05e9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-prime.md","status":"resolved","id":"3322615e4eea05e9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}$（素数谓词，see [[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p,q_1,q_2\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ChenPrime}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}chen-prime} \\vdash \\mathrm{ChenPrime}_S(p)\\leftrightarrow\\left(p\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(p)\\land\\exists q_1,q_2\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\left((q_1=1\\lor\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(q_1))\\land\\operatorname{Prime}_{\\mathbb N}(q_2)\\land p+2=q_1q_2\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false}],"bytes":1033,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-271","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-chen-prime.md|58-df-chen-prime]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["3322615e4eea05e9"]}